% routes.dl with the loop closed: e links back to a.  Lesson 8 uses
% this to show the count semiring diverging honestly on a cyclic graph.
edge(a, b) @ 1.   edge(a, c) @ 2.   edge(b, c) @ 1.
edge(b, d) @ 4.   edge(c, d) @ 2.   edge(d, e) @ 3.
edge(e, a) @ 1.
path(X, Y) :- edge(X, Y).
path(X, Z) :- edge(X, Y), path(Y, Z).
